{
  "name": "Divine Intervention",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call on your deity or pantheon to intervene on your behalf. As a Magic action, choose any Cleric spell of level 5 or lower that requires an Action or a Bonus Action to cast. As part of the same action, you cast that spell without expending a spell slot or needing Material components. You can't use this feature again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
